      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CUMULATE (3) boasts a strong record this journey with five wins and three minors from nine tries. Scored by 2.75 lengths last time (23.48) in a Free For All over 425m at Bendigo. Expected to go close. LADY GUNAI (2) was well supported last time but could only manage second (17.00), beaten 2.5 lengths. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Bold showing expected. FERNLEY GIRL (7) was below best at her last start when 7th at this track following a win (19.37) there two back. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. DUNDEE SKYE (5) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
